<package name="photocraft" project="openSUSE:Factory">
  <title>Native image editor with layers, masks, type and PSD support</title>
  <description>PhotoCraft is an open-source, native image editor with layers, masks,
adjustment layers, layer styles, type and brushes. It opens, edits and
saves layered PSD and PSB files and 8/16/32-bit documents, composited on
the GPU.

This package provides the desktop application; the companion photocraft-cli
subpackage provides the headless converter, batch runner and command server.</description>
  <url>https://github.com/storytold/photocraft</url>
</package>
